[{"text":"SUNT[a] is the \\(SU(N)\\) \\(T^a\\) generator in the fundamental representation. The fundamental indices are implicit.","anchor":"sunt"},{"text":"Overview, CA, CF, SUND, SUNDelta, SUNF, SUNSimplify.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"SUNT[a]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[T^a\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Since \\(T^a\\) is a noncommutative object, products have to separated by a Dot (.).","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SUNT[a] . SUNT[b] . SUNT[c]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[T^a.T^b.T^c\\]","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SUNT[a, b, c, d]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[T^a.T^b.T^c.T^d\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SUNSimplify[SUNT[a, b, a], SUNNToCACF -> False]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[-\\frac{T^b}{2 N}\\]","anchor":"cb4-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SUNSimplify[SUNT[a, b, b, a]]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[C_F^2\\]","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SUNSimplify[SUNT[a, b, a]]","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[-\\frac{1}{2} T^b \\left(C_A-2 C_F\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb6-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SUNSimplify[SUNT[a, b, a], SUNNToCACF -> False]","anchor":"cb7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[-\\frac{T^b}{2 N}\\]","anchor":"cb7-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"The normalization of the generators is chosen in the standard way, therefore \\(\\textrm{Tr}(T^aT^b) = \\frac{1}{2} \\delta _{ab}\\)","anchor":"cb7-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SUNTrace[SUNT[a, b]]","anchor":"cb8","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{\\delta ^{ab}}{2}\\]","anchor":"cb8-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"In case you want \\(T_f\\), you need to include a factor 2*Tfinside the trace.","anchor":"cb8-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SUNTrace[2 Tf SUNT[a, b]]","anchor":"cb9","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[T_f \\delta ^{ab}\\]","anchor":"cb9-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SUNTrace[SUNT[a, b]] // StandardForm","anchor":"cb10","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{2} \\;\\text{SUNDelta}[\\text{SUNIndex}[a],\\text{SUNIndex}[b]]\\]","anchor":"cb10-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SUNT[a] // FCI // StandardForm (*SUNT[SUNIndex[a]]*)","anchor":"cb11","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SUNT[a] // FCI // FCE // StandardForm (*SUNT[a]*)","anchor":"cb12","section":"Examples"}]